BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c4dt-ai-sovereignty-conference-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261024T134407Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261110T093000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261110T180000
SUMMARY:C4DT Conference on AI Sovereignty: Charting Switzerland’s Path
LOCATION:Starling Hotel\, 1025 Saint-Sulpice\, Saint-Sulpice (Lausanne)
DESCRIPTION:A full day on how Switzerland builds strategic independence in 
 AI between US and Chinese dominance — lessons from other middle powers\,
  Swiss research including the Apertus foundation model\, industry deployme
 nt realities\, and concrete recommendations for national strategy.\n\nOrga
 niser: Center for Digital Trust (C4DT)\, EPFL\n\nDetails and registration:
  https://swissdataevents.ch/events/c4dt-ai-sovereignty-conference-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/c4dt-ai-sovereignty-conference-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
